This is a Habit Tracking App that allows the user to set up Habits to keep track on. The Habits have a specific periodicity
in which a task is derived that needs to be checked off by the user. Every check-off, as well as the information whether
the check-off was on-time/overdue and completed/skipped, will be save as an CompletionRecord. The Habits, Tasks and
CompletionRecords will be managed by there specific Repository and saved within an external database.
The User should be able to do different kinds of statistical analysis with the records.

Objects:

Habit
    Attributes
        -habit_name: string
        ~habit_id: int
        -period: [daily, weekly, bi-weekly, monthly]
        -start_date: datetime
        -status: [Active, Paused]
        ~streak: int
    Methods
        ~create_task(): void
        ~recalculate_task(start_date, period): void
        +pause(): void
        +reactivate(): void
        +rename(new_name: string): void
        +change_periodicity(period: Period): void
        +change_start_date(date: datetime): void

HabitRepository
    Methods
        +create(habit: Habit): void
        +update(habit: Habit): void
        +delete(habit: Habit): void
        +browse_all(): Habit[]
        +find_habit_by_name(habit_name: string): Habit[]
        +find_habit_by_id(habit_name: string): Habit

Task
    Attributes
        -habit_name: string
        ~habit_id: int
        ~due_date: datetime
        -check_out: boolean
        -completion_status: [Pending, Completed, Skipped]
    Methods
        +complete(date: datetime): void
        +skip(date: datetime): void
        ~publish_to_record(completion_status: CompletionStatus, date: datetime): void
        ~is_overdue(): boolean

TaskRepository
    Methods
        ~create(task: Task): void
        ~update(task: Task): void
        ~delete(task: Task): void
        +find_task_by_habit_name(habit_name: string): Task
        +find_task_by_habit_id(habit_id: int): Task

CompletionRecord
    Attributes
        ~habit_name: string
        ~habit_id: int
        ~completion_date: datetime
        ~completion_status: CompletionStatus

CompletionRecordRepository
    Methods
        ~add_record(record: CompletionRecord): void
        +find_records_by_habit_name(habit_name: string): CompletionRecord[]
        +find_records_by_habit_id(habit_id: int): CompletionRecord[]
        ~calculate_streak(): int